[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2784479645","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105106#issuecomment-2784479645","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105106","id":2784479645,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6l98md","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-07T19:55:45Z","updated_at":"2025-04-07T19:55:45Z","body":"I don't really get the problem. The title bar has spacers that should ensure the buttons are centered.\r\n\r\nFrom the screenshot it looks like the window title label is not inside the container? Maybe you can simply add a invisible control with minimum size matching the title?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2784479645/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2784488313","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105106#issuecomment-2784488313","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105106","id":2784488313,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6l9-t5","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-07T20:00:01Z","updated_at":"2025-04-07T20:03:40Z","body":"> The title bar has spacers that should ensure the buttons are centered.\r\n\r\nSpacers do not center it, it's:\r\n\r\n`Menu` `Spacer` `Tabs` `Spacer` `Buttons`\r\n\r\n<img width=\"820\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-04-07 at 23 03 09\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2f9db52f-3e47-49da-bc01-b91de8373e52\" />\r\n\r\n`Spacer`s set to expand and will be stretched to the same size. But since `Menu/Title` and `Buttons` are not same width (on non macOS it's almost the same) `Tabs` won't be centered.\r\n\r\n> From the screenshot it looks like the window title label is not inside the container? \r\n\r\nIt's in the one of spacers.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2784488313/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2784536122","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105106#issuecomment-2784536122","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105106","id":2784536122,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6l-KY6","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-07T20:22:14Z","updated_at":"2025-04-07T20:22:28Z","body":"Ok, I hacked the code a bit and reproduced the layout locally.\r\n\r\nFrom what I see, the main problem is that the title label has enabled trimming. If not that, it could be placed next to the spacer instead of inside, effectively fixing the problem. Ideally the label should use all available space and only trim when there is not enough space. There is no way to achieve that with existing options AFAIK, but I assume that's what your solution does.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2784536122/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"hea